.It Ic @ifdef No "" Bro Ar SYM Ns :name! Ar TRUE_TEXT Ns :string! No :optional Ar FALSE_TEXT Ns :string! Brc Ic @
If
.Va SYM
is defined, return
.Va TRUE_TEXT ,
else return
.Va FALSE_TEXT .
The
.Bro Va FALSE_TEXT Brc
